hi I'm rich Briggs brand director at  Crystal Dynamics and I'm excited to show  you the new content were bringing to  rise of the Tomb Raider 20-year  celebration including an exclusive sneak  peek at our new Blood Ties story in rise  of the Tomb Raider Lara uncovers an  ancient mystery that places are in the  crosshairs of a ruthless organization  known as Trinity as she races to find  the secret before them the trail leads  to a myth about the lost city of Kadesh  Lara knows she must reached the lost  city and its hidden secrets before  Trinity so she sets out for Siberia on  her first tomb raiding expedition woman  versus wild is our evolution of survival  action in which Lara battles not only  enemies but the world itself you'll hunt  animals to craft weapons and scavenge  for rare resources in a densely  populated ecosystem you'll encounter  beautifully hostile environment full of  treacherous conditions and unstable  landscapes that will require Lara to  push her limits to the very edge this  includes the new guerrilla combat  tactics where you'll use the environment  to your advantage  scaling trees and diving under water to  avoid or take down enemies and  configuring Lara's gear weapons and ammo  to suit your playstyle from stealth to  guns blazing craft explosives on the fly  to sow chaos and wield Lara's signature  combat bows and climbing axe tombs are  back and they're bigger and better than  ever you'll explore huge inspiring  ancient space is littered with deadly  traps dramatic environmental puzzles and  decipher ancient text to reveal crypts  as you take on a world filled with  secrets to discover  2016 marks the 20th anniversary of the  first Tomb Raider game and we knew we  had to do something special to celebrate  Lara Croft and the impact she's made on  the entertainment industry first we  wanted this to be the most comprehensive  version of the game possible so we  bundled all of the previously released  DLC including the critically acclaimed  baba-yaga single-player story cold  darkness awakening and endurance mode  which you can now play with a friend as  you raid tombs and the frozen Siberian  wilderness together we've created a new  outfit inspired by Tomb Raider 3 as well  as five classic Lara skins it looks  pretty amazing to see the low-poly skins  alongside the beautifully detailed world  and characters of rise of the Tomb  Raider it's a walk down memory lane and  that's just the beginning  we knew that the Manor would be a great  place to explore in Lara's modern  timeline it's such an important part of  Lara's rise and it represents her home  her base her fortune and her legacy  in the new Blood Ties story ownership of  the manor is being contested by Lara's  uncle and she has to explore the estate  for proof that she's the rightful heir  or lose the manor for good lara  experiences flashbacks and collect  documents and journals and relics for  additional backstory on her early years  Lara will discover her father's vault of  knowledge where he was compiling ancient  truths that he kept secret even from her  however we wanted to be sure we had some  action in combat as well which brings us  to Lara's nightmare this is a special  mode in which the manor has been overrun  by zombies there's a psychological  aspect to this because Lara is battling  her inner demons to retain ownership of  her childhood home she'll need to  overcome hordes of infectious zombies as  well as boss battles in order to reclaim  her birthright we're excited about the  upcoming launch of rise of the Tomb  Raider 20 year celebration on October 11  Blood Ties adds over an hour of  completely new story content to an  already robust experience pushing the  total gameplay above 50 hours  in the next episode we'll give you an  inside look at how blood ties can be  experienced in an all-new interactive  virtual reality mode on PlayStation 4  you'll be able to play the world through  Lara's eyes for the first time in  franchise hi